              "content": "<table><tr><td>I/we/you/they he/she/it</td><td>can can&#x27;t (cannot)</td><td>do play see come etc.</td><td>can</td><td>I/we/you/they he/she/it</td><td>do? play? see? come? etc.</td></tr></table>"
